>> title: British Flapjacks
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: oats, golden syrup, british, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: flapjack, oat slice, oat bars, golden syrup flapjacks
>> servings: 9
>> time: 40 min

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Line an #8x8-in pan{} with parchment.

Melt @unsalted butter{10%Tbs}(140 g), @golden syrup{2%Tbs}(40 g), @light brown sugar{1/2%cup}(100 g), @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g) in a #saucepan{}.

Stir @rolled oats{2 1/2%cup}(225 g), @sultanas{1/3%cup}(50 g) into @&(~1)butter syrup{}.

Press @&(~1)oat mixture{} evenly into the pan.

Bake @&(~1)flapjacks{} at 350°F for ~{25%min}.
